      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اختبأ</span></b>  <i>It was,</i> or <i>became, hidden,</i> or <i>concealed:</i> (Mgh:) <i>he hid,</i> or <i>concealed, himself.</i>
(S.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  It is also trans.: see 1. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,]
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اختبأ لَهُ خَبِيْئًا</span></b>  <i>He expressed a thing enigmatically
to him, and then asked him respecting it.</i> (IDrd,
K. [See also 3.])

